From 424122149b7821662ab90de15d1c0e1bcd6b75a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cpkt9762 <cpkt9762@163.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:28:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(dsh): add the DeepSeek Harness adapter

Add a link-only HTTP adapter with no runtime DeepSeek imports, reusing the Pi runtime contract. Expose all 23 operations, scoped prompt/result capture, compaction recovery, serial writes, ledger acknowledgement recovery and isolated satellites, with real Go and DSH host tests.

Preserve reviewed semantics: explicit runtime ownership and restart, scoped identities and continuation after confirmed end/finalize, detached optional-string normalization with literal deletion replacements, private redaction, and deduplicated visible configuration failures.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
